    "message": "test(cli): pin that oss.ts registers patches, not just that it is unstubbed\n\nThe new stub test asserts `patches` is absent from PRO_COMMANDS. That is half\nthe fix: delete the `registerPatchesCommand(program)` call from `oss.ts` and\nthat test still passes while `ix patches` becomes commander's \"unknown\ncommand\" — which is where #371 started.\n\nVerified by removing the registration: the suite stayed green before this\ncommit, and fails on it after.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
